  "intro": {
    "copy": "Crypto has no shortage of complexity, abstraction or technological promises. Commonsense, which builds cryptocurrency portfolios for private and institutional investors, needed a more grounded way to communicate. With the existing logo retained, we developed a visual identity around the idea of Roots of Trust. Honest portraits, natural objects and restrained compositions brought a human dimension to an often impersonal category. A more approachable expression of a sophisticated financial proposition.",
    "title": "Commonsense",
    "subtitle": "Crypto that makes common sense."
  },
