      "title": "CommonSense",
      "subtitle": "Textures",
      "copy": "Built on the concept of “Roots of Trust”, these images reinforce the connection between humanity and transparency in the crypto world.\n\nThe portraits show real people in a simple, approachable way, emphasising that behind the technology and transactions are committed individuals. Natural elements such as fruit and organic objects represent the connection with nature and transparency. Combined with the direct, unaffected expression of the people, they reinforce the message that the platform is not abstract or distant, but an ecosystem driven by real people who bring solidity and trust to the project.\n\nMinimal settings and visual clarity keep the focus on honesty and simplicity, key values of the brand."
    },
